#. de: <if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><else><string $gs1></if><else><string $gs1></if>! Ein Glück, dass du gekommen bist.
